{"id":"torrey:armies-of-israel-the","source":"torrey","name":"Armies Of Israel, The","slug":"armies-of-israel-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"First mention of — Ex 7:4.","refs":[["Exod",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Sound of trumpets. — Jdj 3:27; 6:34.","refs":[["Judg",3,27,3,27],["Judg",6,34,6,34]]},{"text":"Special messengers. — Jdj 6:35; 2Sa 20:14.","refs":[["Judg",6,35,6,35],["2Sam",20,14,20,14]]},{"text":"Extraordinary means. — Jdj 19:29; 20:1; 1Sa 11:7.","refs":[["Judg",19,29,19,29],["Judg",20,1,20,1],["1Sam",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Enroled by the chief scribe — 2Ki 25:19.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,19,25,19]]},{"text":"The host. — De 23:9; 1Sa 28:19.","refs":[["Deut",23,9,23,9],["1Sam",28,19,28,19]]},{"text":"The armies of the living God. — 1Sa 17:26.","refs":[["1Sam",17,26,17,26]]},{"text":"Composed of infantry. — Nu 11:21; Jdj 5:15.","refs":[["Num",11,21,11,21],["Judg",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Horsemen and chariots introduced into, after David’s reign. — 1Ki 1:5; 4:26.","refs":[["1Kgs",1,5,1,5],["1Kgs",4,26,4,26]]},{"text":"Three divisions. — Jdj 7:16; 1Sa 11:11.","refs":[["Judg",7,16,7,16],["1Sam",11,11,11,11]]},{"text":"Van and rear. — Jos 6:9.","refs":[["Josh",6,9,6,9]]},{"text":"Companies of thousands, &c. — Nu 31:14; 2Ki 1:9,11; 1Ch 13:1; 27:1.","refs":[["Num",31,14,31,14],["2Kgs",1,9,1,9],["2Kgs",1,11,1,11],["1Chr",13,1,13,1],["1Chr",27,1,27,1]]},{"text":"Commanded by the captain of the host — 2Sa 2:8; 17:25; 20:23.","refs":[["2Sam",2,8,2,8],["2Sam",17,25,17,25],["2Sam",20,23,20,23]]},{"text":"Often led by the king in person — 1Sa 8:20; 15:4,5; 2Sa 12:29; 1Ki 22:1-53.","refs":[["1Sam",8,20,8,20],["1Sam",15,4,15,4],["1Sam",15,5,15,5],["2Sam",12,29,12,29],["1Kgs",22,1,22,53]]},{"text":"The chief officers. — De 20:9.","refs":[["Deut",20,9,20,9]]},{"text":"The king. — 2Sa 18:1; 2Ch 25:5.","refs":[["2Sam",18,1,18,1],["2Chr",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"The captain of the host. — 2Sa 18:11; 2Ki 4:13.","refs":[["2Sam",18,11,18,11],["2Kgs",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Persons liable to serve in — Nu 1:2,3.","refs":[["Num",1,2,1,2],["Num",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Who had built a house. — De 20:5.","refs":[["Deut",20,5,20,5]]},{"text":"Who had planted a vineyard. — De 20:6.","refs":[["Deut",20,6,20,6]]},{"text":"Who were lately betrothed. — De 20:7.","refs":[["Deut",20,7,20,7]]},{"text":"Who were newly married. — De 24:5.","refs":[["Deut",24,5,24,5]]},{"text":"Refusing to join, stigmatised — Jdj 5:15-17.","refs":[["Judg",5,15,5,17]]},{"text":"Refusing to join, often punished — Jdj 21:5,8-11; 1Sa 11:7.","refs":[["Judg",21,5,21,5],["Judg",21,8,21,11],["1Sam",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"The fearful allowed to leave — De 20:8; Jdj 7:3.","refs":[["Deut",20,8,20,8],["Judg",7,3,7,3]]},{"text":"Sometimes consisted of the whole nation — Jdj 20:11; 1Sa 11:7.","refs":[["Judg",20,11,20,11],["1Sam",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Strict discipline observed in — Jos 7:16-21; 1Sa 14:24-44.","refs":[["Josh",7,16,7,21],["1Sam",14,24,14,44]]},{"text":"Educated in the art of war — Isa 2:4; Mic 4:3.","refs":[["Isa",2,4,2,4],["Mic",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Often supplied with arms from public armouries — 2Ch 11:12; 26:14.","refs":[["2Chr",11,12,11,12],["2Chr",26,14,26,14]]},{"text":"Were numbered and reviewed. — 2Sa 18:1,2,4; 1Ki 10:15,27.","refs":[["2Sam",18,1,18,1],["2Sam",18,2,18,2],["2Sam",18,4,18,4],["1Kgs",10,15,10,15],["1Kgs",10,27,10,27]]},{"text":"Required to keep from iniquity. — De 23:9.","refs":[["Deut",23,9,23,9]]},{"text":"Consulted the Lord. — Jdj 1:1; 20:27,28.","refs":[["Judg",1,1,1,1],["Judg",20,27,20,27],["Judg",20,28,20,28]]},{"text":"Encouraged by their commanders. — 2Ch 20:20.","refs":[["2Chr",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Ark of God frequently brought with — Jos 6:6,7; 1Sa 4:4,5; 2Sa 11:11; 15:24.","refs":[["Josh",6,6,6,6],["Josh",6,7,6,7],["1Sam",4,4,4,4],["1Sam",4,5,4,5],["2Sam",11,11,11,11],["2Sam",15,24,15,24]]},{"text":"Attended by priest with trumpets — Nu 10:9; 31:6; 2Ch 13:13,14.","refs":[["Num",10,9,10,9],["Num",31,6,31,6],["2Chr",13,13,13,13],["2Chr",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"Praises of God often sung before — 2Ch 20:21,22.","refs":[["2Chr",20,21,20,21],["2Chr",20,22,20,22]]},{"text":"Often disposed to battle with Judgment, &c — 2Sa 10:9.","refs":[["2Sam",10,9,10,9]]},{"text":"Bravery and fidelity in, rewarded — Jos 15:16; 1Sa 17:25; 18:17; 2Sa 18:11; 1Ch 11:6.","refs":[["Josh",15,16,15,16],["1Sam",17,25,17,25],["1Sam",18,17,18,17],["2Sam",18,11,18,11],["1Chr",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Men selected from, for difficult enterprises — Ex 17:9; Nu 31:5,6; Jos 7:4; 8:3; Jdj 7:5,6; 2Sa 17:1.","refs":[["Exod",17,9,17,9],["Num",31,5,31,5],["Num",31,6,31,6],["Josh",7,4,7,4],["Josh",8,3,8,3],["Judg",7,5,7,5],["Judg",7,6,7,6],["2Sam",17,1,17,1]]},{"text":"Directed in their movements by God — Jos 8:1,2; Jdj 1:2; 2Sa 5:25; 1Ch 14:16.","refs":[["Josh",8,1,8,1],["Josh",8,2,8,2],["Judg",1,2,1,2],["2Sam",5,25,5,25],["1Chr",14,16,14,16]]},{"text":"With the aid of God all-powerful — Le 26:3,7,8; De 7:24; 32:30; Jos 1:5.","refs":[["Lev",26,3,26,3],["Lev",26,7,26,7],["Lev",26,8,26,8],["Deut",7,24,7,24],["Deut",32,30,32,30],["Josh",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Without God easily overcome — Le 26:17; Nu 14:42,45.","refs":[["Lev",26,17,26,17],["Num",14,42,14,42],["Num",14,45,14,45]]},{"text":"Food brought by themselves. — Jos 1:11.","refs":[["Josh",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Food sent by their families. — 1Sa 17:17.","refs":[["1Sam",17,17,17,17]]},{"text":"Contribution levied. — Jdj 8:5; 1Sa 25:4-8.","refs":[["Judg",8,5,8,5],["1Sam",25,4,25,8]]},{"text":"By presents. — 2Sa 17:27-29.","refs":[["2Sam",17,27,17,29]]},{"text":"Congratulated on returning victorious — 1Sa 18:6,7; Ex 15:1-21.","refs":[["1Sam",18,6,18,6],["1Sam",18,7,18,7],["Exod",15,1,15,21]]},{"text":"Purified on returning from war — Nu 31:19-24.","refs":[["Num",31,19,31,24]]},{"text":"Disbanded after war — 1Sa 13:2; 1Ki 22:36.","refs":[["1Sam",13,2,13,2],["1Kgs",22,36,22,36]]},{"text":"Part of, retained in times of peace by the kings — 1Sa 13:1,2; 1Ch 27:1-15.","refs":[["1Sam",13,1,13,1],["1Sam",13,2,13,2],["1Chr",27,1,27,15]]}],"refCount":121}
